  "description": "Helplessly falling in love at first sight. \n\nJeong-Hyeon is a girl who easily gets carried away by her feelings. On her first day of work as a manager for actress Hee-Ra Ju, she falls head over heels for her! Jeong-Hyeon can't afford to lose her job, but her heart melts every time she sees Hee-Ra's face. Will she be able to hide her feelings? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
